Package: balancesample
Title: Multivariate Balanced Data Splitting for 'rsample'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jeffrey M.", "Girard", , "jeffgirard@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates training/testing splits and cross-validation folds
    that are balanced on several variables at once. Numeric and
    categorical variables are balanced with anticlustering, data
    twinning, rerandomization, or crossed strata. Categorical variables
    can also be stratified exactly, and rows from the same group can be
    kept together. Results are 'rsample' objects, so they work with
    'tune' and the rest of 'tidymodels'.
